            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 adds support for <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFontFaceRule.style</code> being a <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFontFaceDescriptors</code>. This adds a release note and minor updates to docs.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Release note</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> CSSFontFaceRule - make into live example</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127864131\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43564\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43564/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43564\">#43564</a></p>",
