            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Adds   <code class=\"notranslate\">customElementRegistry</code> option for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Element.attachShadow()</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43237.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3984141858\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43237\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43237/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43237\">#43237</a><br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38266.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2868575029\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38266\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38266/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38266\">#38266</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127730538\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43555\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43555/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43555\">#43555</a></p>",
